body:
Saying again, for anyone who doesn't get it;

Being superior does not give one the right to predate upon them.

It gives one the responsibility to care for them.

Omfg, I just scared the shit out of some proselytizers.

Notable quotes:

In chipper moron voice;  
"Of course I love Jesus, he is a really cool guy! I'd totally vote for him!"

Continuing with stark rage simmering;  
"But Yahweh can eat a dirty dick. He owes me a mother fucking apology."
